## Changes made for Mezon

- The Rust bindings are trimmed to the modules this workspace uses.
- The per-file license headers were removed; this NOTICE file carries the notice for every file listed
  above.
- The C++ namespaces are renamed to `mezon_ffi` and `mezon_rtc`, the public headers live in
  `include/mezon_rtc`, and the preprocessor macros, environment variables and scratch paths use
  Mezon names.
- Android JNI lookups use the unprefixed `org.webrtc` package.
- The prebuilt libwebrtc is built by `.github/workflows/webrtc-builds.yml` from
  `webrtc-sdk/webrtc` commit `aaeeee8077eb0a4cad1c9494e9c6433c751ef663` and published on the
  mezon-desktop GitHub releases.

